Compatible with stores from express-session.

If you are terminating HTTPs at the reverse proxy, you need to add the `trustProxy` setting to your fastify instance if you want to use secure cookies.

Defaults to a simple in-memory store.
Note: The default store should not be used in a production environment because it will leak memory.

